- (ALARM BEEPING)

2206
01:55:38.517 --> 01:55:40.285
I'm gonna get you home.

2207
01:55:42.320 --> 01:55:44.389
(SCREAMS)

2208
01:55:45.524 --> 01:55:47.626
(DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING)

2209
01:56:06.278 --> 01:56:07.847
- (SONNY GROANS)
- BRENDA: Sonny.

2210
01:56:09.448 --> 01:56:10.582
Sonny.

2211
01:56:15.587 --> 01:56:16.621
