2212
01:56:18.992 --> 01:56:21.227
Thank you
for bringing him back to me.

2213
01:56:24.798 --> 01:56:26.666
(WIND WHISTLING)

2214
01:56:28.902 --> 01:56:30.603
(CELL PHONE RINGING)

2215
01:56:41.380 --> 01:56:43.016
Mom? Is that you?

2216
01:56:45.418 --> 01:56:47.620
Yeah. They're here.
Where are you?

2217
01:56:49.455 --> 01:56:51.724
